Package: enzan
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: enzan-gui
Description: event-driven mixed-language RTL simulator
 Enzan simulates SystemVerilog and VHDL, each alone or both in one design,
 writes VCD and FST waveforms, and runs cocotb testbenches through VPI and
 VHPI.
 .
 This package is the simulator, VHDL's standard libraries, the VPI and VHPI
 headers and cocotb's makefile for Enzan. The graphical debugging environment
 `enzan --gui` opens is in enzan-gui, so that a machine without a display
 installs no GUI toolkit.

Package: enzan-gui
Architecture: any
Depends: enzan (= ${binary:Version}),
         qt6-qpa-plugins,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: event-driven mixed-language RTL simulator - graphical front end
 Enzan simulates SystemVerilog and VHDL, each alone or both in one design,
 writes VCD and FST waveforms, and runs cocotb testbenches through VPI and
 VHPI.
 .
 This package is the window `enzan --gui` opens on a simulation: its waveform
 view, design structure and transcript.
